  "content": {
    "id": "v2-b537c-p32-practice-slot-8-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": null,
    "prompt": "A cup of tea at $90^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$ is left in a room with a constant temperature of $22^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$. After 4 minutes the temperature of the tea is $66^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "v2-b537c-p32-practice-slot-8-slot-8-q-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "Find the rate at which the tea is cooling after 4 minutes. Give your answer in $^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$/min to 2 decimal places.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$4.79^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$/min.",
          "worked": "Using $T=22+Ae^{-kt}$, where $k>0$:\n$$\\begin{align*}90&=22+A\\\\A&=68\\end{align*}$$\n$$\\begin{align*}66&=22+68e^{-4k}\\\\44&=68e^{-4k}\\\\e^{-4k}&=\\frac{11}{17}\\\\k&=\\frac14\\ln\\left(\\frac{17}{11}\\right)\\end{align*}$$\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{dT}{dt}&=-k(T-22)\\\\&=-\\frac14\\ln\\left(\\frac{17}{11}\\right)(44)\\\\&=-11\\ln\\left(\\frac{17}{11}\\right)\\\\&\\approx-4.79\\end{align*}$$\nThe tea is cooling at $4.79^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$/min.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 70
      },
      {
        "id": "v2-b537c-p32-practice-slot-8-slot-8-q-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "Find the temperature of the tea when it is cooling at $2^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$/min. Give your answer to 1 decimal place.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$40.4^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$.",
          "worked": "Cooling at $2^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$/min means $\\dfrac{dT}{dt}=-2$:\n$$\\begin{align*}-2&=-k(T-22)\\\\T-22&=\\frac2k\\\\&=\\frac{8}{\\ln(17/11)}\\\\&\\approx18.38\\\\T&\\approx40.4^\\circ\\mathrm{C}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 50
      }
    ]
  },
